     1,
     "Hi, <div>I seem to be able to make a temporal ar1 model and a spde spatial model work separately, but when I try to combine together, I don&#39;t get any useful output. I&#39;m not sure if I have the right syntax ... </div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Jennifer<br><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#4f4f4f\"><font color=\"#062599\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></font></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco\">formula3<span style=\"color:#062599\"> &lt;-  </span>y<span style=\"color:#062599\"> ~ </span>x<span style=\"color:#062599\"> + </span>f<span style=\"color:#062599\">(</span>points<span style=\"color:#062599\">, </span>model<span style=\"color:#062599\"> = </span>spde<span style=\"color:#062599\">, </span>group<span style=\"color:#062599\"> = </span>group<span style=\"color:#062599\">, </span>control.group<span style=\"color:#062599\"> = </span>list<span style=\"color:#062599\">(</span>model<span style=\"color:#062599\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#b01406\">&quot;ar1&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#062599\">)) </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco\">r<span style=\"color:#062599\">  = </span>inla<span style=\"color:#062599\">(</span>formula3<span style=\"color:#062599\">, </span>family<span style=\"color:#062599\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01406\">&quot;binomial&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#062599\">, </span>data<span style=\"color:#062599\"> = </span>datam<span style=\"color:#062599\">, </span>Ntrials<span style=\"color:#062599\"> = </span>datam<span style=\"color:#062599\">$</span>n<span style=\"color:#062599\">, </span>verbose<span style=\"color:#062599\">=</span><span style=\"color:#c38816\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:#062599\">)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco\"><font color=\"#062599\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></font></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\"></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\">&gt; summary(r)</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\">Call:</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\">c(&quot;inla(formula = formula1, family = \\&quot;binomial\\&quot;, data = datam, Ntrials = datam$n, &quot;,  &quot;    verbose = TRUE)&quot;)</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\">Time used:</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\"> Pre-processing    Running inla Post-processing           Total </p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\">    0.132059097     1.704269886     0.003979921     1.840308905 </p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\">The model has no fixed effects</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\">The model has no random effects</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\">The model has no hyperparameters</p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14.0px Monaco;color:#062599;min-height:19.0px\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px;font:14